    "scriptBody": "Ninety-nine percent of people build an app\nand **nobody** uses it.\nHere's how to get your first ten users.\n\n**One.** Talk to people who have the problem your app solves.\nNot online. In **person**. DMs. Phone calls.\n\n**Two.** Offer it for **free** to the first five people\nin exchange for honest **feedback**.\n\n**Three.** Post about the **problem** on social media.\nNot your app. The **problem**.\n\n**Four.** Find communities where your target users hang out.\nReddit. Facebook groups. Discord. **Skool**.\nAdd value before you ever **mention** your app.\n\n**Five.** Ask your first five users\nto each bring one **friend**.\n\nYour first ten users should all know your **name**.\nThat's how it starts.",
