    "hookVisual": "Hold up two fingers. Slight lean in. Real talk energy.",
    "caption": "Client work funds the product. The product is the long-term play. Don't choose one -- use one to fund the other.\n\n#vibecoding #freelancing #saas #buildanapp #clientwork #businessstrategy #startup",
    "scriptBody": "There are **two** paths in vibe coding.\n\n**Path one.** Build apps for clients.\nWebsites. Tools. Automations.\nYou get paid **now**. Immediate revenue.\nBut you're trading time for **money**.\n\n**Path two.** Build your own product.\nTakes **longer**. No guaranteed revenue.\nBut if it works, it scales **without** you.\n\nThe **best** move? Do both.\n\nBuild for clients to pay the **bills**\nand fund your own product on the **side**.\n\nClient work teaches you\nwhat people actually **need**.\n\nYour own product is the **long-term** play.\n\nDon't choose one or the other.\nUse one to **fund** the other.",
