    "hookAudio": "If you're building tools with AI, there are **three** ways to sell them.",
    "hookText": "3 tiers to monetize your AI skills",
    "hookVisual": "Hold up three fingers. Confident, teaching energy. Slight nod like \"pay attention.\"",
    "caption": "Three tiers. Three income levels. Tiers two and three are where the real money is right now. Which tier are you at?\n\n#vibecoding #pricing #freelancing #buildanapp #saas #businessstrategy",
    "scriptBody": "If you're building tools with AI,\nthere are **three** ways to sell them.\n\n**Tier one.** SaaS.\nPeople pay monthly. They use it **themselves**.\nLowest price. Highest volume.\nYou build it once, sell it **forever**.\n\n**Tier two.** Done-with-you.\nYou clone the repo,\nhelp them **customize** it for their business.\nMid-price. Mid-touch.\n\n**Tier three.** Done-for-you.\nFull **custom** build for a client.\nHighest price. Most time.\n\nMost builders only think about tier **one**.\n\nBut tiers two and three\nare where the **real** money is right now.\n\nBecause most people still can't build\non their **own** yet.",
