    "scriptBody": "If you can build apps with AI tools,\nyou can **charge** for it.\nBut most people underprice themselves.\n\nA simple website build?\n**Five hundred** to two thousand dollars.\n\nA custom web app with database and auth?\n**Two** to ten thousand dollars.\n\nAn automation workflow for a business?\n**One** to five thousand dollars.\n\nA voice agent setup?\n**Two** to five thousand dollars\nplus a monthly **retainer**.\n\nPrice based on the **VALUE** to the client,\nnot the time it takes you.\n\nIf an automation saves a business\n**fifty thousand** dollars a year,\ncharging five thousand for it is a **steal**.\n\nDon't price based on how long it took you to **build**.\nPrice based on what it's worth to **THEM**.",
