    "content": "Stop Designing, Start Shipping",
    "sourceFile": "SCRIPTS.md",
    "scriptNumber": "Script 4",
    "createdAt": "2026-03-01T18:42:10.827Z",
    "category": "MVP & Launch",
    "status": "NOT YET FILMED",
    "hookAudio": "**Stop** making your app pretty. It doesn't need to look good to make money.",
    "hookText": "STOP making your app pretty",
    "hookVisual": "Hand up in a \"stop\" gesture. Stern face, then soften as you explain.",
    "caption": "Functionality first. Design second. Send this to someone who's been \"almost done\" for months.\n\n#shipfast #mvp #appdevelopment #vibecoding #buildanapp",
    "scriptBody": "**Stop** making your app pretty. It doesn't need to look good to make money.\n\nI know that sounds crazy. But hear me out.\n\nI work with people building apps **every single day**.\nAnd the ones who get stuck the longest?\nThe ones obsessing over colors, fonts, and spacing\nbefore their **buttons even work**.\n\n**Functionality** first. Design second.\n\nGet the thing working.\nGet it in front of people.\nGet feedback.\n**Then** make it pretty.\n\nNobody's paying for your color palette.\nThey're paying because your app **solves their problem**.\n\nUgly apps that work\n**beat** beautiful apps that don't exist.",
    "cta": "Share this with someone who's been 'almost done' for three months."
