    "caption": "$0.13/min vs thousands on a call center. The math isn't even close.\n\n#aiautomation #businessautomation #aivoiceagent #servicebusiness #ai",
    "scriptBody": "**Thirteen cents** a minute. That's what it costs for AI to answer your business phone.\n\nI showed this to a law firm\nthat was spending **thousands** on a call center.\nHundreds of leads going completely uncontacted.\n\nWe set up an AI voice agent.\nIt picks up the phone.\nAsks the right intake questions.\nQualifies the lead.\nBooks the appointment.\nAll **automated**.\n\nThe cost? About thirteen to fourteen cents per minute.\n\nCompare that to a call center.\nOr a full-time employee sitting there.\n\nThe AI doesn't take lunch breaks.\nDoesn't call in sick.\nAnd it picks up **every single time**.\n\nAm I saying fire your whole team? **No.**\nBut the manual stuff --\nthe repetitive questions, the scheduling, the follow-ups --\nthat can be automated **today**.\nAnd most businesses have no idea.",
    "cta": "If you run a service business, this is the year to automate. Follow for more."
