    "caption": "Building is half the job. Distribution is the other half nobody talks about.\n\n#applaunch #appmarketing #mvp #startup #buildanapp",
    "scriptBody": "You built an app and **nobody** downloaded it. Here's why.\n\nBecause you spent three months **building**\nand **zero** time distributing.\n\nI see this constantly.\nSomeone builds something incredible.\nReal problem. Real solution.\nAnd then they just... put it out there.\nMaybe post about it once.\nAnd then? **Nothing**.\n\nBuilding the app is only **half** the job.\nThe other half is getting it in front of people.\n\nThat means collecting testimonials **before** you launch.\nThat means pre-selling to a waitlist.\nThat means telling the story of **why** you built it.\nNot just what it does.\n\nPeople don't buy features.\nThey buy **transformations**.\n\nWhat does someone's life look like **after** they use your app?\nIf you can't answer that clearly?\nNo amount of marketing is going to save you.",
