    "caption": "If you can't walk me through your process step by step, it's not ready to automate yet.\n\n#automation #businessautomation #workflow #servicebusiness #aiautomation",
    "scriptBody": "**Stop** trying to automate a process you haven't written down yet.\n\nThis is the mistake I see service businesses make **all** the time.\n\nThey come to me and say\n'I want to automate my workflow.'\n\nAnd I say 'Great. Walk me through it. Step by step.'\n\nAnd they **can't**.\n\nBecause the process is all in their head.\nOr it's split between three people\nand nobody has the **full** picture.\n\nBefore you automate **anything** --\nyou need to **map it out**.\n\nStep one is what?\nStep two is what?\nWho does what?\nWhat triggers the next step?\n\n**Write it down.** All of it.\n\nBecause if you try to automate something messy?\nAll you get is **automated mess**.\n\nClean process first. Automation second.\n**Every** time.",
    "cta": "Tag someone who needs to hear this before they buy another software subscription."
