    "scriptBody": "Nobody shows you what learning vibe coding **actually** looks like.\n\nThey show you the finished app.\nThe clean demo. The **result**.\n\nThey don't show you the part where\nyou're learning Cursor, GitHub, Supabase,\nMCP servers, and deployment\nall at the **same time**.\n\nAnd you feel like you're drowning.\nLike you're completely **in the weeds**.\n\nBut here's what I've learned\nfrom working with people going through this.\n\nThe ones who make it\naren't the ones who found it **easy**.\nThey're the ones who got **comfortable**\nbeing uncomfortable.\n\nThey laugh about being lost.\nThey ask for help.\nThey keep **maneuvering**.\n\nAnd then one day --\nthe thing that confused them last week\nsuddenly **clicks**.\n\nThat's the real journey.\nNot the polished demo.\nThe messy, overwhelming, in-the-weeds part\nthat nobody wants to show you.\n\nBut that's where all the growth **happens**.",
    "cta": "If you're in the weeds right now -- drop a comment. You're not alone."
