    "scriptBody": "Nobody in the vibe coding space is saying what my community **actually** says on our calls.\n\nOne member said -- 'They stop people in the street, say one sentence, and raise money the next day. That's so **delusional**.'\n\nAnother one said -- 'Lovable put me in a false sense of security. Those apps were so nice. But they were a **fluke**. I realized I don't know anything about what I'm doing.'\n\nAnother one -- 'You **can't** cut out the hard work. I don't wanna cook the roast when I got the microwave right here, but it's never gonna be the **same** result.'\n\nAnd someone asked for **honesty** --\n'Just tell us what the boundaries are. What these tools can **actually** deliver right now. Without the delusions.'\n\n**That's** my community.\n\nThey're not selling dreams.\nThey're **building** things.\nAnd they're honest about every part of the process.\n\nThat honesty is the reason they're actually **finishing** what they start.",
