    "scriptBody": "The ChatGPT App Store **just opened**\nand nobody's talking about it.\n\nOpenAI is now accepting **submissions**\nfor apps built on ChatGPT.\n\nThis is what people thought the **GPTs** were gonna be.\nBut this is the real thing.\n\nThink about it.\nWhen Apple launched the **iOS App Store** --\nthe people who got in **early** built empires.\n\nThis is that moment for **AI apps**.\n\nYou can now build something,\nsubmit it,\nand have it distributed\nto **hundreds of millions** of ChatGPT users.\n\nThe barriers are **lower** than the App Store.\nNo Swift. No Xcode. No Apple review nightmare.\n\nLovable and Replit are already **integrated** with ChatGPT.\nYou can start building and submitting **today**.\n\nThis window will not stay this open.\nThe early movers **always** win.",
