    "hookVisual": "Lean in close, eyes wide, pointing at camera like you're about to share a secret",
    "caption": "Google's Notebook LM is quietly one of the most powerful AI tools out right now and most people have never even opened it. Upload your notes, your docs, your learning materials -- and watch what happens.\n\n#notebooklm #aitools #vibecoding #techtools #aihacks #googleai #studywithai #productivityhacks",
    "scriptBody": "**Nobody** is talking about this tool.\n\nGoogle's Notebook LM might be the most **underrated** AI tool right now.\n\nHere's what it does.\n\nYou upload **any** information --\nyour notes, your documents, your learning materials --\n\nand it turns them into **flashcards**.\n**Slide decks**.\n**Infographics**.\n**Mind maps**.\n**Video overviews**.\nAnd **deep research** summaries.\n\nAll from the stuff you **already** have.\n\nPeople are using this to study for **certification exams**.\nPeople are using this to build **SOPs** for their entire operations.\n\nIt connects to **Gemini** for deep research,\nso it doesn't just reorganize your information --\nit **expands** on it.\n\nIf you're studying something,\nif you're building presentations for work,\nif you need to turn **messy notes** into something structured --\n\nthis tool does it for **free**.\n\nAnd almost **nobody** knows about it.\n\nGo try it **today**.",
